// NORMALIZED install-side (tools/normalize_mors_loc.js: body 1.0 / head 5.0; PaP damage re-encoded 1000->2000).
// Sniper ability category + sniper Overclock family. PaP = s1_mors_up.
weapon,s1_mors
weapon,s1_mors_up

// Chicom CQB (BO2 t6_chicom_cqb) = 3-round-burst SMG box gun, S+ tier (user 2026-06-25). Single-wield
